From 5babc2f692fc99548e77a9a6469af5084bc7d69e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: decaf-phase1 <decaf@local>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:51:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Component A: position-disentangled store (env-gated
 DECAF_POSITION_FREE)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- sidecar: per-block absolute start position (block_starts), asserted == n_init + b*block_size
- retrieval unchanged (stock already scores pre-RoPE content keys; audit finding)
- rotate-on-fetch: retrieved blocks rotated to exact sidecar positions; question/decode
  tokens at true streaming positions via PositionalKV (next_pos = store length at query)
- instrumentation: DECAF_RETRIEVAL_LOG jsonl (per-layer retrieved blocks + similarities),
  DECAF_RECALL_ONLY, calc_memory_usage_detailed
- verification: decaf_trapcheck.py (T1 store-is-pre-RoPE, T2 rotary reproduction vs W2.1
  dumps, T3 rotate-on-fetch plumbing, T4 alignment, T5 stock equivalence vs W2.5),
  compute_recall.py (temporal oracle), gate1_verdict.py

NOTE: runs MUST set PYTHONPATH=code/decaf — the rekv env editable-installs code/ReKV.
