+        # offloaded block in the full token stream. Block b holds tokens
+        # [n_init + b*block_size, n_init + (b+1)*block_size) by construction
+        # (init tokens are extracted first, blocks are cut in order). The
+        # trap-check script asserts this identity against the store.
